---
// Privacy policy aplikace AE TRANSLATOR pro Shopify App Store.
//
// POZOR NA URL: stránka je záměrně BEZ jazykového prefixu (/privacy-policy),
// protože na tuhle adresu odkazuje listing aplikace v Shopify App Store.
// Po výměně webu pod doménou musí adresa odpovídat dál - nesmí zaniknout
// ani se přesunout (karta webu AI13009, položka AE-33).
//
// Text je převzatý doslova ze starého webu (verze 17. 2. 2026) - je to
// právní dokument, nepřepisuje se.
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - AE TRANSLATOR"
  description="Privacy policy for the AE TRANSLATOR Shopify application by AETHERO s.r.o."
  lang="en"
>

  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="hero-blob" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <p class="legal-eyebrow">AE TRANSLATOR</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-date">17. 2. 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-primary">
    <div class="container legal-body">
      <p>
        AE TRANSLATOR (“App”) is provided by AETHERO s.r.o., Czech Republic
        (“we”, “us”, “our”). This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use,
        and process data when merchants install and use the App in connection
        with their Shopify store. If you are a merchant installing the App, you
        are the “Merchant” under this Policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">1. Scope</h2>
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy applies to data processed through the AE TRANSLATOR
        Shopify application available via the Shopify App Store. The App is
        designed to translate Shopify store content (products, pages, blogs, and
        translations). The App does not process or store end-customer (shopper)
        personal data.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">2. Data We Collect and Process</h2>

      <h3 class="h4">2.1 Merchant and Store Data (via Shopify API)</h3>
      <p>When a Merchant installs the App, we access the following Shopify API scopes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>read_content</li>
        <li>read_locales</li>
        <li>read_products</li>
        <li>read_translations</li>
        <li>write_translations</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This allows us to access and process:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Product titles and descriptions</li>
        <li>Store pages and blog content</li>
        <li>Store locales and languages</li>
        <li>Existing translations</li>
        <li>Writing translated content back to Shopify</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not request access to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Customers</li>
        <li>Orders</li>
        <li>Checkouts</li>
        <li>Payment data</li>
        <li>Any end-customer personally identifiable information (PII)</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="h4">2.2 Authentication and Session Data</h3>
      <p>To provide secure access to the App, we store:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Shopify shop domain</li>
        <li>OAuth state and granted scopes</li>
        <li>Shopify access token</li>
        <li>Staff user ID</li>
        <li>Staff name and email address (for app access control and job attribution)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This data is used solely for authentication, authorization, and app functionality.</p>

      <h3 class="h4">2.3 Translation and Job Data</h3>
      <p>For translation processing, we may temporarily process and store:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Content submitted for translation (e.g., product titles, descriptions, pages)</li>
        <li>Source and target languages</li>
        <li>Translation results</li>
        <li>Translation rules and merchant-configured dictionary</li>
        <li>Batch/job names</li>
        <li>Job status, results, and error logs</li>
        <li>Optional staff email for “batch completed” notifications</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This data is used strictly to perform translation services and return results to Shopify.</p>

      <h3 class="h4">2.4 API Settings and Configuration</h3>
      <p>Per merchant store, we may store:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Selected translation provider</li>
        <li>Merchant-provided API keys (e.g., DeepL, OpenAI-compatible providers, Anthropic Claude)</li>
        <li>SMTP credentials for sending translation completion emails</li>
      </ul>
      <p>API keys and SMTP credentials are stored securely and used only:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>To call the merchant’s chosen translation service</li>
        <li>To send merchant-configured email notifications</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not use these credentials for any other purpose.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">3. End-Customer Data</h2>
      <p>
        AE TRANSLATOR does not collect, store, or process end-customer (shopper)
        data. We do not access:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Customer names</li>
        <li>Emails</li>
        <li>Addresses</li>
        <li>Order history</li>
        <li>Checkout information</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The App processes only merchant data and store content.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">4. How We Use the Data</h2>
      <p>We use collected data solely to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Authenticate merchants</li>
        <li>Provide translation functionality</li>
        <li>Write translations back to Shopify</li>
        <li>Manage translation batches</li>
        <li>Improve app reliability and performance</li>
        <li>Provide technical support</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell data. We do not use merchant content for advertising or profiling.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">5. Data Storage and Hosting</h2>
      <p>Primary hosting location: European Union (Czech Republic)</p>
      <p>Infrastructure provider: Linode (Akamai Cloud Services)</p>
      <p>App URL: <a href="https://aetr.aethero.cz">https://aetr.aethero.cz</a></p>
      <p>
        We apply appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect
        data against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">6. Third-Party Services and Subprocessors</h2>
      <p>We may share data only as necessary to operate the App:</p>

      <h3 class="h4">Shopify</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>OAuth authentication</li>
        <li>Shopify API (content and translations)</li>
        <li>Required webhooks for compliance</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="h4">
        Translation Providers (only if enabled and configured by the Merchant
        using their own API keys)
      </h3>
      <ul>
        <li>DeepL</li>
        <li>OpenAI or OpenAI-compatible APIs (e.g., DeepSeek)</li>
        <li>Anthropic (Claude)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Content submitted for translation is transmitted to the selected provider
        solely for translation purposes.
      </p>

      <h3 class="h4">Hosting</h3>
      <p>
        Linode (Akamai Cloud Services). We do not share data with third parties
        for marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">7. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain merchant and translation data only as long as necessary to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide translation services</li>
        <li>Maintain app functionality</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Upon app uninstallation, we delete or anonymize merchant data within a
        reasonable period, except where retention is required by law.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">8. Merchant Rights (GDPR and Applicable Laws)</h2>
      <p>
        If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), United Kingdom,
        or other jurisdictions with data protection laws, you may have rights
        including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Right of access</li>
        <li>Right to rectification</li>
        <li>Right to erasure</li>
        <li>Right to restriction of processing</li>
        <li>Right to data portability</li>
        <li>Right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Requests may be submitted to: <a href="mailto:info@aethero.cz">info@aethero.cz</a></p>
      <p>
        We also comply with Shopify’s mandatory data protection webhooks for data
        access and erasure requests.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">9. International Transfers</h2>
      <p>
        If translation providers process data outside the EU/EEA, transfers occur
        under appropriate safeguards in accordance with applicable data
        protection laws.
      </p>
      <p>
        Merchants are responsible for ensuring that their selected translation
        provider complies with applicable laws.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3">10. Security</h2>
      <p>We implement reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Encrypted connections (HTTPS/TLS)</li>
        <li>Secure storage of API credentials</li>
        <li>Access controls</li>
        <li>Logging and monitoring</li>
      </ul>
      <p>However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.</p>

      <h2 class="h3">11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updates will be posted at:</p>
      <p><a href="https://aetr.aethero.cz/privacy-policy">https://aetr.aethero.cz/privacy-policy</a></p>

      <h2 class="h3">12. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        AETHERO s.r.o., Czech Republic <br />
        Website: <a href="https://www.aethero.cz">https://www.aethero.cz</a> <br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:info@aethero.cz">info@aethero.cz</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 130px 0 80px;
    background: var(--ae-bg-primary);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-blob {
    position: absolute;
    top: -20%;
    right: -5%;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(80, 20, 160, 0.4) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(90px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .legal-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--action);
  }
  .hero-inner h1 {
    font-size: var(--fs-70);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .legal-date {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--neutral-500);
  }

  .section {
    padding: var(--space-64) 0 var(--space-120);
  }
  .legal-body {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .legal-body h2 {
    margin: var(--space-64) 0 var(--space-16);
  }
  .legal-body h3 {
    margin: var(--space-32) 0 var(--space-8);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .legal-body p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }
  .legal-body ul {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-24);
    padding-left: 22px;
  }
  .legal-body li {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }
  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--action);
    text-decoration: underline;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 100px 0 50px;
    }
  }
</style>
